{"messages":[{"text":"🌡️ Las temperaturas volverán a subir este lunes y rozarán los 40 ºC en Badajoz, Ourense y zonas de Andalucía.\n🌶️ Septiembre insiste en venir disfrazado de agosto.","buttons":[{"label":"Abrir en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8C%A1%EF%B8%8F%20Las%20temperaturas%20volver%C3%A1n%20a%20subir%20este%20lunes%20y%20rozar%C3%A1n%20los%2040%20%C2%BAC%20en%20Badajoz%2C%20Ourense%20y%20zonas%20de%20Andaluc%C3%ADa.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Septiembre%20insiste%20en%20venir%20disfrazado%20de%20agosto."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 1 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8C%A1%EF%B8%8F%20Las%20temperaturas%20volver%C3%A1n%20a%20subir%20este%20lunes%20y%20rozar%C3%A1n%20los%2040%20%C2%BAC%20en%20Badajoz%2C%20Ourense%20y%20zonas%20de%20Andaluc%C3%ADa.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20El%20calendario%20dice%20septiembre%3B%20el%20term%C3%B3metro%20ha%20pedido%20una%20segunda%20opini%C3%B3n."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 2 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8C%A1%EF%B8%8F%20Las%20temperaturas%20volver%C3%A1n%20a%20subir%20este%20lunes%20y%20rozar%C3%A1n%20los%2040%20%C2%BAC%20en%20Badajoz%2C%20Ourense%20y%20zonas%20de%20Andaluc%C3%ADa.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20El%20oto%C3%B1o%20llama%2C%20pero%20de%20momento%20le%20responde%20el%20aire%20acondicionado."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 3 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8C%A1%EF%B8%8F%20Las%20temperaturas%20volver%C3%A1n%20a%20subir%20este%20lunes%20y%20rozar%C3%A1n%20los%2040%20%C2%BAC%20en%20Badajoz%2C%20Ourense%20y%20zonas%20de%20Andaluc%C3%ADa.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Negar%20el%20calentamiento%20global%20empieza%20a%20exigir%20m%C3%A1s%20ventiladores%20que%20argumentos."}],"search_terms":["temperaturas","AEMET","40 grados"]},{"text":"🏀 España avanza a semifinales del Europeo femenino de baloncesto 3x3 en Amberes.\n🌶️ Tres contra tres y España ya está entre las cuatro: economía de jugadoras, derroche de resultado.","buttons":[{"label":"Abrir en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%80%20Espa%C3%B1a%20avanza%20a%20semifinales%20del%20Europeo%20femenino%20de%20baloncesto%203x3%20en%20Amberes.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Tres%20contra%20tres%20y%20Espa%C3%B1a%20ya%20est%C3%A1%20entre%20las%20cuatro%3A%20econom%C3%ADa%20de%20jugadoras%2C%20derroche%20de%20resultado."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 1 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%80%20Espa%C3%B1a%20avanza%20a%20semifinales%20del%20Europeo%20femenino%20de%20baloncesto%203x3%20en%20Amberes.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Espa%C3%B1a%20reduce%20plantilla%20y%20ampl%C3%ADa%20ambici%C3%B3n."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 2 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%80%20Espa%C3%B1a%20avanza%20a%20semifinales%20del%20Europeo%20femenino%20de%20baloncesto%203x3%20en%20Amberes.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20En%203x3%20caben%20menos%20jugadoras%2C%20pero%20de%20momento%20sobra%20torneo."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 3 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%80%20Espa%C3%B1a%20avanza%20a%20semifinales%20del%20Europeo%20femenino%20de%20baloncesto%203x3%20en%20Amberes.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Si%20esto%20sigue%20as%C3%AD%2C%20habr%C3%A1%20que%20explicar%20que%20el%203x3%20no%20significa%20tres%20medallas."}],"search_terms":["España","baloncesto 3x3","Europe Cup"]},{"text":"🏎️ Antonelli gana el GP de España en Madring y amplía su liderato. Verstappen y Norris completan el podio; mal día para Alonso y Sainz.\n🌶️ Madrid estrenó circuito; Antonelli estrenó victoria y los españoles, ganas de pasar página.","buttons":[{"label":"Abrir en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%8E%EF%B8%8F%20Antonelli%20gana%20el%20GP%20de%20Espa%C3%B1a%20en%20Madring%20y%20ampl%C3%ADa%20su%20liderato.%20Verstappen%20y%20Norris%20completan%20el%20podio%3B%20mal%20d%C3%ADa%20para%20Alonso%20y%20Sainz.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Madrid%20estren%C3%B3%20circuito%3B%20Antonelli%20estren%C3%B3%20victoria%20y%20los%20espa%C3%B1ole